identify=Pilot|Streamline Discs|Neutron|orange swirl|unknown|8|14|Special Edition Pilot putter with full-color pilot/jet foil stamp — helmeted pilot with fighter jets and clouds. Swirly orange Neutron plastic with darker marbling. Stamp is bright and mostly intact with minor foil flaking on the helmet. Light scuffs and a few small dark scratches on the rim edge. No ink or dyes. Nice-looking collectible special edition stamp.
